Model weights downloaded at runtime

Kety ships with no model weights. When a user installs a model from Settings,
it is downloaded from Hugging Face directly to that user's machine. Kety does
not redistribute any of these files; they are listed here so their terms are
easy to find.

  Whisper (ggml conversions)          MIT
    https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp
    Original model: OpenAI Whisper (MIT), https://github.com/openai/whisper

  Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct-GGUF          Apache-2.0
  Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct-GGUF          Apache-2.0
  Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B-GGUF           Apache-2.0
  Qwen3-Embedding-4B-GGUF             Apache-2.0
    https://huggingface.co/Qwen

  Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct-GGUF            Qwen Research License Agreement
    https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct-GGUF
    Unlike the other Qwen models offered, this one is NOT Apache-2.0. Its
    licence restricts use to research and non-commercial purposes. Read it
    before installing this model.
